{"messages":[{"content":"Graph contract: kind=graph. nodes contains distinct strings. edges contains [from,to,cost] triples with positive integer fuel costs and at most one edge per ordered pair. start and goal are nodes; fuel is a nonnegative integer. plan is an ordered list of destination node names. Every edge is directed. Start at {node:start,fuel:fuel}. An action is legal exactly when an edge from the current node to its destination exists and its cost is at most the remaining fuel. A legal move changes node to its destination and subtracts the edge cost. At the first illegal action, include that action's {legal:false,after:unchanged_state} step, stop immediately, and do not evaluate subsequent actions. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed action was legal. reaches_goal is true exactly when the whole plan is valid and its terminal node is goal, including an initially satisfied goal with an empty plan. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL state that reaches goal within initial fuel, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the entire destination-name sequence. It is [] for an initially satisfied goal and null if no feasible plan exists. Fuel cost is a feasibility constraint, not the optimization objective. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:{node:string,fuel:integer}}], after:{node:string,fuel:integer}, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"plan\":[\"Ember\",\"Aster\",\"Beryl\",\"Dune\"],\"fuel\":8,\"goal\":\"Dune\",\"start\":\"Ember\",\"edges\":[[\"Ember\",\"Aster\",4],[\"Aster\",\"Beryl\",2],[\"Beryl\",\"Dune\",2]],\"nodes\":[\"Ember\",\"Aster\",\"Beryl\",\"Dune\"],\"kind\":\"graph\"}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"fuel\":8,\"node\":\"Ember\"},\"reaches_goal\":false,\"shortest_plan\":[\"Aster\",\"Beryl\",\"Dune\"],\"steps\":[{\"after\":{\"fuel\":8,\"node\":\"Ember\"},\"legal\":false}],\"valid\":false}","role":"assistant"}]}
{"messages":[{"content":"Blocks contract: kind=blocks. on maps each distinct block name to a support block or TABLE. TABLE is reserved, supports must exist, and self-support, cycles, or more than one block directly on a block are malformed. TABLE may support several blocks. goal_on is a partial map using existing blocks or TABLE; self-support, cycles, and multiple blocks directly assigned to one block are contradictory and malformed. The initial state and goals here are well-formed. A block is clear when no block is directly on it. plan is an ordered list of {block,to} actions. A move is legal exactly when block exists and is clear, to is TABLE or an existing clear block distinct from block, and to differs from block's current support. A legal move changes only that block's support. At the first illegal move, include its {legal:false,after:unchanged_on_map} step, stop immediately, and ignore subsequent moves. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed move was legal. reaches_goal means the entire plan is valid and every goal_on entry equals the final on-map entry; unspecified supports need not change. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL on-map that satisfies every goal_on entry, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the complete sequence of (block,to) string pairs. It is [] when the initial state already satisfies the goal and null if unreachable. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:on_map}], after:on_map, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"blocks\",\"on\":{\"amber\":\"TABLE\",\"cobalt\":\"amber\",\"birch\":\"TABLE\"},\"goal_on\":{\"amber\":\"birch\"},\"plan\":[{\"block\":\"amber\",\"to\":\"birch\"},{\"block\":\"cobalt\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"amber\",\"to\":\"birch\"}]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"amber\":\"TABLE\",\"birch\":\"TABLE\",\"cobalt\":\"amber\"},\"reaches_goal\":false,\"shortest_plan\":[{\"block\":\"cobalt\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"amber\",\"to\":\"birch\"}],\"steps\":[{\"after\":{\"amber\":\"TABLE\",\"birch\":\"TABLE\",\"cobalt\":\"amber\"},\"legal\":false}],\"valid\":false}","role":"assistant"}]}
{"messages":[{"content":"Blocks contract: kind=blocks. on maps each distinct block name to a support block or TABLE. TABLE is reserved, supports must exist, and self-support, cycles, or more than one block directly on a block are malformed. TABLE may support several blocks. goal_on is a partial map using existing blocks or TABLE; self-support, cycles, and multiple blocks directly assigned to one block are contradictory and malformed. The initial state and goals here are well-formed. A block is clear when no block is directly on it. plan is an ordered list of {block,to} actions. A move is legal exactly when block exists and is clear, to is TABLE or an existing clear block distinct from block, and to differs from block's current support. A legal move changes only that block's support. At the first illegal move, include its {legal:false,after:unchanged_on_map} step, stop immediately, and ignore subsequent moves. An empty plan is valid. valid means every proposed move was legal. reaches_goal means the entire plan is valid and every goal_on entry equals the final on-map entry; unspecified supports need not change. shortest_plan is a fresh plan from the INITIAL on-map that satisfies every goal_on entry, minimizes the number of moves, and breaks ties by the lexicographic order of the complete sequence of (block,to) string pairs. It is [] when the initial state already satisfies the goal and null if unreachable. Return exactly a JSON object with steps:[{legal:boolean,after:on_map}], after:on_map, valid:boolean, reaches_goal:boolean, shortest_plan:list_or_null. Include only evaluated steps.\nTask JSON:\n{\"plan\":[{\"to\":\"birch\",\"block\":\"amber\"},{\"to\":\"TABLE\",\"block\":\"cobalt\"},{\"to\":\"birch\",\"block\":\"amber\"}],\"goal_on\":{\"amber\":\"birch\"},\"on\":{\"birch\":\"TABLE\",\"cobalt\":\"amber\",\"amber\":\"TABLE\"},\"kind\":\"blocks\"}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"amber\":\"TABLE\",\"birch\":\"TABLE\",\"cobalt\":\"amber\"},\"reaches_goal\":false,\"shortest_plan\":[{\"block\":\"cobalt\",\"to\":\"TABLE\"},{\"block\":\"amber\",\"to\":\"birch\"}],\"steps\":[{\"after\":{\"amber\":\"TABLE\",\"birch\":\"TABLE\",\"cobalt\":\"amber\"},\"legal\":false}],\"valid\":false}","role":"assistant"}]}
